OL,3,AInterest rates hiked to 4% in first
OL,4,Aincrease in over three years
OL,5,
OL,6,FInterest rates have risen for the first
OL,7,Ftime in more than three years and the
OL,8,FBank of England has signalled a further
OL,9,Fincrease is likely unless the US-Iran
OL,10,Fwar is resolved.
OL,12,FRates rose to 4% from 3.75% in a bid to
OL,13,Fcurb inflation mainly driven by the
OL,14,Fconflict's impact on global oil prices.
OL,16,FAndrew Bailey, the Bank's governor,
OL,17,Fsaid the decision "shouldn't be seen as
OL,18,Fthe first in an inevitable long
OL,19,Fsequence of hikes", but warned "unless
OL,20,Fthe conflict in the Middle East is
OL,21,Fresolved, neither does it seem likely
OL,22,Fto be the last increase".
